{"ticker":"PODD","updated":"2026-10-23T23:47:29Z","profile":{"longName":"Insulet Corporation","shortName":"Insulet Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"United States","website":"https://www.insulet.com","fullTimeEmployees":5400,"marketCap":10334469120,"trailingPE":27.904493,"forwardPE":19.296114,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3845775,"pegRatio":1.16,"targetMeanPrice":167.1739,"targetHighPrice":215.0,"targetLowPrice":143.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.235,"earningsGrowth":3.286,"grossMargins":0.71075,"operatingMargins":0.16178,"profitMargins":0.12291,"totalRevenue":3053400064,"beta":1.101,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":354.88,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":126.4,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Insulet Corporation develops, manufactures, and sells insulin delivery systems for people with insulin-dependent diabetes in the United States and internationally. The company offers Omnipod platform products comprising Omnipod 5 automated insulin delivery system, which includes a proprietary AID algorithm embedded in the pod that integrates with a third-party continuous glucose monitor to obtain glucose values through wireless Bluetooth communication; Omnipod DASH insulin management system that features a Bluetooth enabled pod that is controlled by a smartphone-like personal diabetes manager with a color touch screen user interface; and the Omnipod Insulin Management System. It also provides pods for Amgen for use in the Neulasta Onpro kit, which is a delivery system to help reduce the risk of infection after intense chemotherapy. The company sells its products to end-users through the pharmacy channel; and independent distributors. Insulet Corporation was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Acton, Massachusetts.","summary_zh":"Insulet Corporation 為美國和國際上的胰島素依賴型糖尿病患者開發、製造和銷售胰島素輸送系統。該公司提供的 Omnipod 平台產品包括 Omnipod 5 自動胰島素輸送系統，該系統包括嵌入在 pod 中的專有 AID 演算法，該演算法與第三方連續血糖監測儀集成，透過無線藍牙通訊獲取血糖值； Omnipod DASH 胰島素管理系統，具有藍牙功能的 pod，由類似智慧型手機的個人糖尿病用戶界面管理器和彩色觸控系統控制器；它還為安進提供用於 Neulasta Onpro 套件的 Pod，這是一種輸送系統，有助於降低密集化療後的感染風險。公司透過藥局通路向最終用戶銷售產品；和獨立經銷商。 Insulet Corporation 成立於 2000 年，總部位於馬薩諸塞州阿克頓。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":329.88,"h":330.76,"l":327.17,"c":329.0,"v":517300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":330.58,"h":332.33,"l":328.87,"c":331.83,"v":493000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":331.49,"h":335.86,"l":329.65,"c":334.35,"v":517000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":332.08,"h":337.84,"l":331.75,"c":337.6,"v":458000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":337.31,"h":341.14,"l":335.81,"c":339.88,"v":515200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":338.13,"h":350.0,"l":334.91,"c":344.92,"v":788600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":346.64,"h":346.64,"l":339.0,"c":343.53,"v":595500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":343.34,"h":349.09,"l":341.89,"c":346.47,"v":499600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":345.27,"h":348.72,"l":345.27,"c":348.43,"v":498500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":349.56,"h":350.0,"l":345.56,"c":349.56,"v":526500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":349.27,"h":353.5,"l":347.31,"c":352.82,"v":656700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":350.68,"h":351.11,"l":330.0,"c":337.61,"v":800800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":337.69,"h":342.4,"l":336.04,"c":337.94,"v":563700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":337.75,"h":351.94,"l":336.0,"c":341.78,"v":472900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":342.0,"h":345.74,"l":339.98,"c":340.29,"v":335500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":340.72,"h":345.2,"l":328.93,"c":332.13,"v":812100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":332.13,"h":333.1,"l":313.24,"c":322.22,"v":1109000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":322.03,"h":334.91,"l":319.13,"c":333.51,"v":684800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":333.51,"h":333.72,"l":328.76,"c":330.84,"v":1028500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":330.31,"h":336.02,"l":327.86,"c":335.12,"v":431500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":332.95,"h":335.58,"l":326.48,"c":327.8,"v":435700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":329.79,"h":330.21,"l":324.64,"c":326.97,"v":576200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":324.5,"h":324.5,"l":312.59,"c":323.58,"v":745500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":323.51,"h":326.29