3JrdHduMHh5a3VsZFI1aGFjeVV5MWwtQ25YQ2JTN1kxX0xFZFVtZDV1TUpUdk91TElFWkJJQTJpaFM2cFJUT1ZDMDRXelZzZHRPNElTNE5uYmV1V2lpOHJMZFFNemdReXB0dldrbUxaQ0x6aVBWUTZyTGZFVnk4dHhiS0hoWkU?oc=5","date":"2026-10-12","zh":"PODD 2026 年第二季收益：每股盈餘成長 12.2%，推動股價走高 - 負面的意外動能"},{"title":"Revenue Outlook Raised Could Be A Game Changer For Insulet Stock (PODD)","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-10","zh":"收入前景的提高可能會改變 Insulet 股票 (PODD) 的遊戲規則"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1145197/000114519726000028/podd-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Insulet Corporation (\"we\" or the \"Company\") is primarily engaged in the development, manufacture, and sale of its proprietary continuous insulin delivery systems for people with insulin-dependent diabetes. The Omnipod platform includes: the Omnipod 5 Automated Insulin Delivery System (\"Omnipod 5\"), the Omnipod DASH Insulin Management System (\"Omnipod DASH\"), and the Omnipod Insulin Management System (\"Classic Omnipod\").","zh":"Insulet Corporation（「我們」或「本公司」）主要從事為胰島素依賴型糖尿病患者開發、製造和銷售其專有的連續胰島素輸送系統。 Omnipod 平台包括：Omnipod 5 自動胰島素輸送系統（「Omnipod 5」）、Omnipod DASH 胰島素管理系統（「Omnipod DASH」）和 Omnipod 胰島素管理系統（「Classic Omnipod」）。"},{"en":"We also produce pods for Amgen for use in the Neulasta Onpro kit, a delivery system for Amgen's Neulasta to help reduce the risk of infection after intense chemotherapy.","zh":"我們也為安進生產 Neulasta Onpro 套件的 Pod，這是安進 Neulasta 的輸送系統，有助於降低密集化療後的感染風險。"},{"en":"Diabetes is a chronic, life-threatening disease for which there is no known cure. It is caused by the body's inability to produce or effectively utilize the hormone insulin, which prevents the body from adequately regulating blood glucose levels. Glucose, the primary source of energy for cells, must be maintained at certain concentrations in the blood in order to permit optimal cell function and health. In people with diabetes, blood glucose levels fluctuate between very high levels, a condition known as hyperglycemia, and very low levels, a condition called hypoglycemia. Hyperglycemia can lead to serious short-term complications, such as confusion, vomiting, dehydration, and loss of consciousness and long-term complications, such as blindness, kidney disease, nervous system disease, occlusive vascular diseases, stroke, cardiovascular disease, or death. Hypoglycemia can lead to confusion","zh":"糖尿病是一種慢性、危及生命的疾病，目前尚無已知的治癒方法。它是由身體無法產生或有效利用胰島素激素引起的，胰島素會阻止身體充分調節血糖水平。葡萄糖是細胞的主要能量來源，必須在血液中維持一定的濃度，以達到最佳的細胞功能和健康。糖尿病患者的血糖水平在非常高的水平（稱為高血糖）和非常低的水平（稱為低血糖）之間波動。高血糖可導致嚴重的短期併發症，如精神錯亂、嘔吐、脫水和意識喪失，以及長期併發症，如失明、腎臟疾病、神經系統疾病、閉塞性血管疾病、中風、心血管疾病或死亡。低血糖會導致意識混亂"}],"markets":[{"en":"We sell Omnipod products to wholesalers that supply the pharmacy channel in the United States. In addition, we sell Omnipod products through distribution partners and directly to consumers. For the year ended December 31, 2025, 86% of Omnipod product sales globally were through intermediaries.","zh":"我們向美國藥局通路供貨的批發商銷售 Omnipod 產品。此外，我們也透過分銷合作夥伴直接向消費者銷售 Omnipod 產品。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的年度，全球 86% 的 Omnipod 產品銷售是透過中間商完成的。"},{"en":"Our sales and marketing efforts are focused on customer acquisition and retention to meet user, clinician, and payor demands for our Omnipod products. We have a comprehensive sales and marketing approach, which communicates the benefits of the Omnipod platform to users, physicians, and providers. This includes three areas of focus:","zh":"我們的銷售和行銷工作專注於客戶獲取和保留，以滿足使用者、臨床醫生和付款人對我們的 Omnipod 產品的需求。我們擁有全面的銷售和行銷方法，可以向使用者、醫生和提供者傳達 Omnipod 平台的優勢。這包括三個重點領域："}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The diabetes medical device market is highly competitive, subject to rapid change, and significantly affected by new product introductions. Our Omnipod platform competes for consumers in the insulin delivery market. Because most new Omnipod users come from MDI therapy, which currently is the most prevalent method of insulin delivery, we believe that we primarily compete with companies that provide products and supplies for MDI therapy, including smart pens. We also compete with companies in the insulin pump market, which today consists of tubed pump companies, in addition to companies that are working to develop and market new insulin \"patch\" pumps and other methods for the treatment of insulin-dependent diabetes. We are also aware of the increasing use of GLP-1 products that may delay the progression of type 2 diabetes in obese patients.","zh":"糖尿病醫療器材市場競爭激烈，變化迅速，並受到新產品推出的顯著影響。我們的 Omnipod 平台在胰島素輸送市場上爭取消費者。由於大多數 Omnipod 新用戶來自 MDI 療法，這是目前最受歡迎的胰島素輸送方法，因此我們認為，我們主要與為 MDI 療法提供產品和用品（包括智慧筆）的公司競爭。我們也與胰島素幫浦市場的公司競爭，目前該市場由管式幫浦公司以及致力於開發和銷售新型胰島素「貼片」幫浦和其他治療胰島素依賴型糖尿病的方法的公司組成。我們也意識到 GLP-1 產品的使用增加可能會延緩肥胖患者第 2 型糖尿病的進展。"},{"en":"Many of our research and development efforts are focused on making improvements to Omnipod 5, including adding features and functionality that will deliver increased economic value and convenience to users. Advances in innovation in 2025 include the following:","zh":"我們的許多研發工作都集中在改進 Omnipod 5 上，包括添加可為使用者帶來更高經濟價值和便利性的特性和功能。 2025 年的創新進展包括："}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product Omnipod","val":2674000000,"zh":"產品全能型"},{"name":"U.S.Omnipod","val":1919800000,"zh":"美國全能機器人"},{"name":"International Omnipod","val":754300000,"zh":"國際全能"},{"name":"Drug Delivery","val":34100000,"zh":"藥物輸送"}],"total":2708100000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":1953900000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":754300000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":2708100000}},"peers":["DXCM","TNDM","PEN","RMD","WST"]}}